WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.452 --> 00:00:02.458
(soft music)

00:00:02.458 --> 00:00:05.186
(breathes heavily)

00:00:05.186 --> 00:00:07.661
(page turns)

00:00:07.661 --> 00:00:10.078
(soft music)

00:00:13.332 --> 00:00:16.445
(engine whirs)

00:00:16.445 --> 00:00:19.028
(upbeat music)

00:00:32.644 --> 00:00:35.420
(door opens)

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:37.480
- I know you haven't been
sleeping in your room,

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:41.180
so, where, exactly, have you
been spending your nights?

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:44.770
- Yeah, feel free to help out too Joey.

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:46.360
- Actually, I was gonna head
into town for a little bit,

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:48.820
and take some pictures
before we hit the road.

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:51.233
Remember, like we said we would?

00:00:52.850 --> 00:00:54.540
You're gonna be okay here?

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:56.135
- I think I'll be fine, Joey.

00:00:56.135 --> 00:00:58.718
(upbeat music)

00:01:05.230 --> 00:01:07.460
- [Male Narrator] And a
boy looked out his window,

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:09.024
at the girl next door.

00:01:09.024 --> 00:01:11.255
(upbeat music)

00:01:11.255 --> 00:01:13.334
(breathes heavily)

00:01:13.334 --> 00:01:15.260
- Don't get me wrong, I
love a good floor show,

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:17.460
but, if this a response
to Jughead threatening

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:19.630
your masculinity or whatever.

00:01:19.630 --> 00:01:21.394
- I'm just getting my daily workout in.

00:01:21.394 --> 00:01:23.811
(soft music)

00:01:32.343 --> 00:01:34.483
(water runs)

00:01:34.483 --> 00:01:36.900
(soft music)

00:01:42.846 --> 00:01:44.759
- Thought you might want some company.

00:01:44.759 --> 00:01:47.176
(soft music)

00:01:52.564 --> 00:01:55.147
(upbeat music)

00:02:04.702 --> 00:02:06.133
- No please, no don't!

00:02:06.133 --> 00:02:07.772
(fire smolders)

00:02:07.772 --> 00:02:08.634
Ah!

00:02:08.634 --> 00:02:11.217
(upbeat music)

00:02:12.943 --> 00:02:15.026
- [Woman] Archie, Archie.

00:02:16.150 --> 00:02:18.733
(upbeat music)

00:02:54.657 --> 00:02:57.181
(shoes tapping)

00:02:57.181 --> 00:02:58.976
(body slams)

00:02:58.976 --> 00:02:59.809
- Archie!

00:02:59.809 --> 00:03:02.312
- Gonna need some strong
allies I can trust.

00:03:02.312 --> 00:03:04.060
(door opens)

00:03:04.060 --> 00:03:06.320
Archie Andrews, what a surprise.

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:08.150
- I heard you're trying to buy Riverdale.

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:10.190
You gotta step up and lead the Bulldogs.

00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:11.490
- I'm already captain bro.

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:14.740
- Yeah, I'm not talking
about on the field.

00:03:14.740 --> 00:03:16.170
I need you to work with Jughead,

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:18.480
to keep the peace between the
Serpents and the Bulldogs.

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:22.146
No more circles, red, dark or otherwise.

00:03:22.146 --> 00:03:22.980
- Done.

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:24.077
- Archie!

00:03:24.077 --> 00:03:26.310
(soft music)

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:27.340
Are you listening to me?

00:03:27.340 --> 00:03:28.173
- Yeah.

00:03:29.970 --> 00:03:31.480
- We have to burn all of our clothes,

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:33.273
including Jughead's baby.

00:03:33.273 --> 00:03:36.010
- You think you can attack
us from the shadows,

00:03:36.010 --> 00:03:39.550
but Riverdale, is a lot stronger than you,

00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:40.600
and we're not afraid.

00:03:41.626 --> 00:03:43.896
(water runs)

00:03:43.896 --> 00:03:46.479
(upbeat music)

00:03:50.426 --> 00:03:53.574
(punching bag jingles)

00:03:53.574 --> 00:03:55.991
(soft music)

00:04:01.533 --> 00:04:04.283
(crowd applauds)

00:04:08.093 --> 00:04:10.510
(soft music)

